{"id":"888d885c3585f2c1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NCongruence.md","title":"NCongruence","display":"NCongruence","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NCongruence","parameters":["r","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NCongruence"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>r</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>r</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NCongruence r R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ NMode r)\n  (and\n    (exists T (and (@ NTermSet T) (@ EquivOn T R)))\n    (and\n      (forall t (forall u (implies (@ NAx r t u) (@ Edge R t u))))\n      (forall c\n        (forall t\n          (forall u\n            (forall tt\n              (forall uu (implies (and (@ NPlug c t tt) (and (@ NPlug c u uu) (@ Edge R t u))) (@ Edge R tt uu))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"170e22e2feddb645\" href=\"?note=170e22e2feddb645\" title=\"ZFC_EquivOn\">EquivOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db9c3028662cd4b5\" href=\"?note=db9c3028662cd4b5\" title=\"ZFC_NAx\">NAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e430f284172300e\" href=\"?note=2e430f284172300e\" title=\"ZFC_NMode\">NMode</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5beb47cd93dd9865\" href=\"?note=5beb47cd93dd9865\" title=\"ZFC_NPlug\">NPlug</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2a9b89b978fc779\" href=\"?note=e2a9b89b978fc779\" title=\"ZFC_NTermSet\">NTermSet</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NCongruence r R)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_NAx|NAx]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NPlug|NPlug]]；[[ZFC_NTermSet|NTermSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_EquivOn","status":"resolved","id":"170e22e2feddb645","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_NAx|NAx]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NPlug|NPlug]]；[[ZFC_NTermSet|NTermSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NAx","status":"resolved","id":"db9c3028662cd4b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_NAx|NAx]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NPlug|NPlug]]；[[ZFC_NTermSet|NTermSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NMode","status":"resolved","id":"2e430f284172300e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_NAx|NAx]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NPlug|NPlug]]；[[ZFC_NTermSet|NTermSet]]","embed":false},{